sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant W as Web App
    actor DB as Database
    U->>+W: Open dashboard
    W->>+DB: SELECT widgets
    DB-->>-W: rows
    W-->>-U: Rendered page
    loop Every minute
        W->>W: refresh cache
    end
    alt cache hit
        W-)U: push update
    else miss
        W-xDB: timeout
    end
    Note right of U: User sees data
    Note over W,DB: Shared note
